# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Scene hl1-button (test/README.md): '+' textures over time and a button's
# alternate (docs/specs/world-surfaces.md 4). The dome view of hl1-dome
# (uplink.route lines 27-31): its monitors (+0scrn, +0lab1_comp10b/c/e,
# 3 frames at 5 per second) shot 0.3 s apart (2-4 tenths: another frame);
# then uplink.route lines 34-50: the elevator opens, its button (func_button
# *27, +0elev_up2) before and right after +use (frame 1: +aelev_up2).
# scene-window: uplink start elevator
startmap hldemo1
waitmap hldemo1 60
setpos -2048 744 36
wait 2
stats begin
setpos -2048 -496 70 0 270
wait 4
setpos -2000 -620 196 0 270
wait 26
shot screens-a
wait 0.3
shot screens-b
wait 12
setpos -2327 -230 196 0 180
waitmoved startele1 15
setpos -2500 -100 196 0 0
wait 1
shot button-off
+use
wait 0.3
-use
shot button-on
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
